* **Ask your attorney:** "What are the potential legal options or strategies we can use to protect both my business interests and my custody rights simultaneously?" 

Taking this list into your next meeting or sending it to her in an email ahead of time will help ensure you cover all your bases and leave the meeting with a clear understanding of the road ahead.
